00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:13,960
Why is Tim finding this trip exciting?
为什么蒂姆觉得这次旅行令人激动？

2
00:00:13,960 --> 00:00:18,570
Why is Tim finding this trip exciting?
为什么蒂姆觉得这次旅行令人激动？

3
00:00:20,920 --> 00:00:25,050
I have just received a letter from my brother, Tim.
我刚刚收到弟弟蒂姆的来信。

4
00:00:25,790 --> 00:00:27,480
He is in Australia.
他正在澳大利亚。

5
00:00:28,480 --> 00:00:30,850
He has been there for six months.
他在那儿已经住了六个月了。

6
00:00:31,760 --> 00:00:33,630
Tim is an engineer.
蒂姆是个工程师。

7
00:00:34,670 --> 00:00:43,020
He is working for a big firm and he has already visited a great number of different places in Australia.
他正在一家大公司工作，并且已经去过澳大利亚的不少地方了。

8
00:00:44,480 --> 00:00:53,910
He has just bought an Australian car and has gone to Alice Springs, a small town in the centre of Australia.
他刚买了一辆澳大利亚小汽车，现在去了澳大利亚中部的小镇艾利斯斯普林斯。

9
00:00:54,660 --> 00:00:56,770
He will soon visit Darwin.
他不久还将到达达尔文。

10
00:00:57,840 --> 00:01:00,710
From there, he will fly to Perth.
从那里，他再飞往珀斯。

11
00:01:01,700 --> 00:01:08,730
My brother has never been abroad before, so he is finding this trip very exciting.
我弟弟以前从未出过国，因此他觉得这次旅行非常激动人心。
